==========  admin =============

# api call for creating admin 

###
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/accounts/admin/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username":"admin",
    "email":"admin123@gmail.com",
    "password":"admin123",
    "phone":"9056783423"
}

============  normal User ===================

# api call for creating a normal user

###
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/accounts/user/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "ali",
    "email": "alia@gmail.com",
    "phone": "9116534500",
    "password": "aali123"
}

# =========== JWT Token ==================

# api call for creating jwt token pair

###
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/accounts/user/token/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "ali",
    "password": "aali123"

}


